      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if i want to keep fighting it though. sometimes i just think about him and i feel like i'm just waiting to be with him again. it almost feels like it would be easier to just... go to where he is. would that even be wrong? to just want to be where the silence isn't so lonely?",
